Subtask 2.2: Apply Updates Using Hammer CLI
Access the Satellite server terminal and use Hammer CLI to apply errata:
# List available errata for a specific host
hammer host errata list --host client2.example.com

# Apply specific erratum by ID
hammer host errata apply --host client2.example.com --errata-ids RHSA-2023-1234

# Apply all security errata to a host
hammer host errata apply --host client2.example.com --errata-ids $(hammer host errata list --host client2.example.com --search "type=security" --fields "Erratum ID" --csv | tail -n +2 | tr '\n' ',')
Verify the job was created successfully:
# List recent jobs for the host
hammer job-invocation list --search "host=client2.example.com" --order "id DESC" --per-page 5
