Subtask 3.3: Create Recurring Update Jobs Using Hammer
Create a recurring job template for security updates:
# Create a recurring job for security updates
hammer recurring-logic create \
  --cron-line "0 2 * * 0" \
  --end-time "2024-12-31 23:59:59" \
  --max-iteration 52

# Get the recurring logic ID from the output
RECURRING_ID=1

# Create job template for errata application
hammer job-template create \
  --name "Weekly Security Updates" \
  --job-category "Katello" \
  --provider-type "script" \
  --template-inputs "errata=security"
Schedule the recurring job:
# Schedule recurring errata application
hammer job-invocation create \
  --job-template "Apply Errata - Katello Script Default" \
  --search-query "name ~ client" \
  --inputs "errata=security" \
  --recurring-logic-id $RECURRING_ID
