In this lab, you have successfully learned how to manage system updates using Red Hat Satellite. You accomplished the following key tasks:

Identified and reviewed available errata for security, bugfix, and enhancement updates
Applied updates to individual and multiple hosts using both Web UI and Hammer CLI
